%!PS
/bar { 0 rlineto 0 2 rlineto closepath fill } def
/s (Hello World) def
s length 0 0 moveto bar
s 6 5 getinterval length 2 2 moveto bar
/t 10 string def t 0 (abc) putinterval t 0 get 4 4 moveto bar
s (World) search { length exch length add exch length add 6 6 moveto bar } if
s (Hell) anchorsearch { pop length 8 8 moveto bar } if
/a [ 1 2 3 4 5 ] def a 2 get a length add 10 10 moveto bar
a 1 3 getinterval aload pop add add 12 12 moveto bar
/b 3 array def 7 8 9 b astore pop b 2 get 14 14 moveto bar
a 1 3 getinterval /c exch def c 0 99 put a 1 get 16 16 moveto bar
123 10 string cvs length 18 18 moveto bar
255 16 10 string cvrs length 20 20 moveto bar
(42) cvi 22 22 moveto bar
(3.5) cvr 24 24 moveto bar
(abc) cvn type /nametype eq { 3 } { 4 } ifelse 26 26 moveto bar
[1 2] type /arraytype eq { 3 } { 4 } ifelse 28 28 moveto bar
<48656c6c6f> length 30 30 moveto bar
<~87cURD]i,"Ebo80~> length 32 32 moveto bar
(a\(b\)c\n\101) length 34 34 moveto bar
16#FF 36 36 moveto bar
2#1010 1.5e1 add 38 38 moveto bar
[ 3 { 1 } repeat ] length 40 40 moveto bar
a xcheck { 1 } { 2 } ifelse 42 42 moveto bar
{ 1 } xcheck { 3 } { 4 } ifelse 44 44 moveto bar
a cvx xcheck { 5 } { 6 } ifelse 46 46 moveto bar
a rcheck { 7 } { 8 } ifelse 48 48 moveto bar
a readonly wcheck { 1 } { 9 } ifelse 50 50 moveto bar
/u (abcdef) def u 2 3 getinterval /v exch def v 0 (XY) putinterval u length 52 52 moveto bar
(x) dup length exch pop 54 54 moveto bar
mark /k1 1 /k2 2 .5 counttomark 56 56 moveto bar cleartomark
